---
// DetectorsBento.astro - Bento Grid of 19 Built-in Detectors + 12 Global National IDs
---

<section id="detectors" class="py-16 px-4 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyber-neon/10 border border-cyber-neon/30 text-cyber-neon text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase mb-3">
      <span translate="no" aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined notranslate text-sm shrink-0">verified_user</span>
      100.00% PRECISION • 0 FALSE POSITIVES (<span translate="no" class="notranslate">ACCURACY_EVAL</span>)
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-3">
      19 Built-in Detectors &amp; 12 Global IDs <br />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyber-neon via-cyber-cyan to-cyber-purple">
        Mathematical Checksum Verification
      </span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-cyber-muted text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <code class="font-mono text-cyber-neon text-sm">pii-veil</code> validates every candidate with IIN/BIN prefixes, Shannon entropy, dihedral Verhoeff / Mod-11 / Mod-97 checksums, and contextual anti-FP guards.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Bento Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
    
    <!-- Bento 1: Financial & Cards (Large) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-cyber-neon/60 transition shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <span translate="no" aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined notranslate text-3xl text-cyber-neon">credit_card</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-cyber-neon/10 text-cyber-neon border border-cyber-neon/30 font-bold">
          FINANCIAL CORE
        </span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Banking &amp; Payment Systems</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-cyber-muted mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Validated through official IIN/BIN issuer ranges and formal checksums. Rejects Snowflake IDs, timestamps, and random 16-digit numbers.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Credit Cards <strong class="text-cyber-neon">(IIN/BIN + Luhn)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • International IBAN <strong class="text-cyber-cyan">(ISO 13616 Mod-97)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Visa, MC, Amex, Discover, JCB, UnionPay
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento 2: Global Regional National IDs (Large) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-cyber-cyan/60 transition shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <span translate="no" aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined notranslate text-3xl text-cyber-cyan">badge</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-cyber-cyan/10 text-cyber-cyan border border-cyber-cyan/30 font-bold">
          12 GLOBAL IDS
        </span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Global Government &amp; Tax Identifiers</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-cyber-muted mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Strict regional modulo, Verhoeff, and HMRC verification algorithms prevent false alerts on order IDs and invoices.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • ES DNI/NIE <strong class="text-cyber-cyan">(Mod-23)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • AR CUIT/CUIL <strong class="text-cyber-neon">(AFIP Mod-11)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • CL RUT <strong class="text-amber-400">(Mod-11)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • BR CPF/CNPJ <strong class="text-cyber-neon">(Dual Mod-11)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • MX CURP <strong class="text-cyber-cyan">(RENAPO Mod-10)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • US SSN / CA SIN <strong class="text-cyber-purple">(Luhn)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • UK NINO <strong class="text-slate-300">(HMRC)</strong>
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • IN Aadhaar <strong class="text-amber-400">(Verhoeff)</strong> &amp; PAN
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • DE Steuer-ID <strong class="text-cyber-cyan">(Mod 11,10)</strong>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento 3: Secrets & Cloud Keys -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-cyber-purple/60 transition shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <span translate="no" aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined notranslate text-3xl text-cyber-purple">key</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-cyber-purple/10 text-cyber-purple border border-cyber-purple/30 font-bold">
          DEVSECOPS &amp; SARIF 2.1.0
        </span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Cloud Infrastructure &amp; API Keys</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-cyber-muted mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Filtered with O(N) Shannon entropy and placeholder guards. Emits zero-PII SARIF 2.1.0 directly to GitHub Code Scanning.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • OpenAI &amp; Anthropic (<code class="text-cyber-neon">sk-proj-*</code>, <code class="text-cyber-cyan">sk-ant-*</code>)
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • AWS, GitHub, Stripe, Slack, Google API
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • DB URIs (<code class="text-cyber-cyan">postgres://, mongodb://, redis://</code>)
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Webhooks (Slack &amp; Discord) &amp; PEM / JWT
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento 4: Personal Data, Telemetry & Opt-in NER -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-cyber-neon/60 transition shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <span translate="no" aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined notranslate text-3xl text-cyber-neon">public</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-cyber-neon/10 text-cyber-neon border border-cyber-neon/30 font-bold">
          PRIVACY &amp; LAYERED NER
        </span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Telemetry, Contact Info &amp; Opt-in NER</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-cyber-muted mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Scrubs contact metadata with asset/version anti-FP filters, plus pluggable <code class="text-cyber-neon font-mono">NerDetector</code> &amp; <code class="text-cyber-cyan font-mono">--features ner</code> for names &amp; addresses.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Emails (rejects <code class="text-slate-400">hero@2x.png</code>)
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Phones (rejects dates &amp; port lists)
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • IPv4 / IPv6 / MAC (rejects <code class="text-slate-400">v1.2.3.4</code> &amp; <code class="text-slate-400">dead::beef</code>)
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border text-slate-200">
          • Opt-in EN/ES <strong class="text-cyber-neon">PERSON</strong> &amp; <strong class="text-cyber-cyan">ADDRESS</strong> NER
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
